BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mindfulness for Stress
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260604T213000
UID:c4b1f07b36e7a50ba907a509@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This eight-week evidence-based course is designed to help you 
 manage stress and overwhelm in your life. This course teaches practical mi
 ndfulness tools to reduce stress\, calm anxiety\, and bring balance to dai
 ly life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindfulness-for-stress-j
 un-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Foundations of Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260620T103000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260620T123000
UID:0b608217b0ca37ac1bd7a6c6@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Think you can't meditate? This course helps you work with your
  mind to unlock clarity\, creativity\, and emotional strength. Explore a B
 uddhist vision of life\, build a practical toolbox to get the best out of 
 your mind\, and learn two core meditation approaches: calm concentration a
 nd emotional resilience.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/foundations-of-meditatio
 n-jun-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Daytime Buddhism & Meditation Class
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260624T103500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260624T123000
UID:9e65af75491c54f54bab5e83@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:In this series\, we will be exploring the essential teachings 
 of Buddhism. We will do this by way of talks\, discussion and workshops lo
 oking at the Three Jewels – Buddha\, Dharma\, Sangha – and seeing how 
 these can guide us in our lives today.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/daytime-buddhism-24-jun
END:VEVENT
